  "title": "",
  "body": "  You should be able to answer all parts of this problem without ever finding the equations of the functions involved.   Suppose is a linear function with multiplier . If , what is ? ? ? ?   Suppose is a linear function with multiplier . If , for what value of is ? ? ? ?   Suppose is a linear function with and . What is ? ?   "
