  "body": "  Suppose we wanted to know how long the epidemic lasts. We could use DO–WHILE and keep stepping forward using, say , so long as . As soon as was less than 1 we would want to stop and see what the value of was.   What modifications would you make in SIRVALUE to get this information?   Run your modified program. What value do you get for ?   Run the program using . Now what is your estimate for the duration of the epidemic? What can you say about the actual time required for to drop below 1?   "
