  "title": "",
  "body": "  If we think the epidemic started with a single individual, we can go backwards in time until is no longer greater than 1, and see what the corresponding time is. Do this for . What is your best estimate for the time that the infection arrived?   How many Recovereds were there at the start of the epidemic? This would be the people who had presumably been infected in a previous epidemic and now had immunity.   "
